%R	2729903	83219766	106343	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-08 08:10: not done</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-14 14:10: Must wait for TPO roof to be complete</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-27 13:10: Sleeves are installed, but collector boxes are not installed. Delay caused by incorrect grade.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-03 14:11: Progressive needs to correct crooked sections of roof in order to install downspouts</P><P>Freddy Arrizon on 2025-11-10T20:24:45.181Z: Progressive corrected cricket slopes at overflow locations. Suntec, Progressive, and Layton reviewing tomorrow at 07:00am. </P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-10 14:11: Will be done by end of next week. Walking 11/11, 5 days to fab, 3 days to install.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-11 14:11: Scupper opening changed and therefore grading height changed. </P><P>Freddy Arrizon on 2025-11-18T19:15:36.945Z: Suntec needs to correct scupper and overflow dimensions. Suntec couldn't access scuppers due to BZI Crane activity on the SS of Zone 1. </P><P>Freddy Arrizon on 2025-11-24T20:06:11.444Z: Crane Activity at the southside of DC1 for TES tank install is preventing Suntec from repairing Zone 1 and Zone 2 scupper dimensions. Will need to re-sequence this activity. Zone 3 first, Zone 1, then lastly Zone 2. </P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-24 13:11: Close and add new line following zone 3.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-01 14:14: Delayed until crane for roof pipe moves to zone 2 on 12/5.</P><P>Chris Waddell on 2025-12-09 14:22: Need to talk to Ron before updating, will update on 12/10/25</P><P>Ron Carroll on 2025-12-15T20:00:21.974Z: Scuppers will be done today. Collector boxes will be complete 12/19. Bel-aire will start downspouts Monday12/22.</P><P>Ron Carroll on 2025-12-15T20:00:26.655Z: null</P><P>Ron Carroll on 2025-12-15 13:00: Scuppers will be done today. Collector boxes will be complete 12/19. Bel-aire will start downspouts Monday12/22.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-30 16:35: No update</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2729904	83222782	106343	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Chris Waddell on 2025-11-18T20:17:24.167Z: Pushed due to rain this week</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-24 13:11: RFI to confirm loading dock elevations.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-01 14:08: RFI to resolve conflicting grade and concrete heights is still pending. Response expected 12/2.</P><P>Chris Waddell on 2025-12-09 14:31: Waiting on RFI confirming elevation, will update when answer is received</P><P>Ron Carroll on 2025-12-15T19:43:37.699Z: RFI 719 was returned and there will need to be rework made to Suntec's ramp wall. The ramp wall will need to have 5' added to the wall. Grading will happen after the wall in complete. Tentative date for Suntec to start rework is 12/22.</P><P>Ron Carroll on 2025-12-15 12:45: RFI 719 was returned and there will need to be rework made to Suntec's ramp wall. The ramp wall will need to have 5' added to the wall. Grading will happen after the wall in complete. Tentative date for Suntec to start rework is 12/22.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-30 16:35: No update</P></BODY></HTML>
