%R	2729907	83222667	106343	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-08-26 10:08: Received update from QTS that they submitted round 4 of comments and is now expected to approve 9/5.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-07 14:10: Approval pushed again</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-21 08:10: Pushed another week.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-27 11:10: Update per Chris Perales text on 10/24/25</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-02 08:13: No EPCOR Approval</P></BODY></HTML>
