%R	2729910	83222709	106343	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-12-02 12:42: Need to confirm when Pads will be complete and OEG can get crane/fork to set.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-12-16 13:56: From my recent updates we are looking at possibly setting these on 12/22 so will request these for 12/22. Confirming with OEG and Suntec now.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-12-30 09:58: Received and set on 12/29</P></BODY></HTML>
