%R	2729920	83221753	106343	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-12-30 10:41: SCRs will be delivered when we are ready to set. The Mfg/Vendor has these located in their yard in Texas, but we are not going to ship all of these to site to store and then mobilize a separate crane and additional trucks to bring to the building. That would be a decent cost and significantly more coordination, with no added benefit.<br><br>Ultimately, I, John Capriotti (OFCI), need an update from the Subs/Supers as to when we intend to set them so I can schedule the delivery to support those set dates.<br><br>**I will press for updated dates on these, moving out as I work on getting estimated set dates.</P></BODY></HTML>
