%R	2730078	83219570	106343	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-28 16:10: Working on crane sequencing for equipment.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-11-04 15:11: From my understanding we are waiting on a few walls to be finished, meeting tomorrow with Belaire to discuss when and how many to bring in each day.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-16 15:17: not yet</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-12-30T15:16:27.512Z: Actualizing ROJ: DOAS delivered to QAE yard on 10/2 - technically have it just not delivered to the site from QAE yard until I can confirm set date</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2730079	83221582	106343	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-11-04 14:11: Plan is to receive and set this on 11/10</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-11 17:11: John owes 11/11 update</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-12-09 12:39: Pending confirmation on timing from Belaire on this. Followed up on 12/9.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-16 15:16: not yet</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-12-30 10:37: SCRs will be delivered when we are ready to set. The Mfg/Vendor has these located in their yard in Texas, but we are not going to ship all of these to site to store and then mobilize a separate crane and additional trucks to bring to the building. That would be a decent cost and significantly more coordination, with no added benefit.<br><br>Ultimately, I, John Capriotti (OFCI), need an update from the Subs/Supers as to when we intend to set them so I can schedule the delivery to support those set dates.<br><br>**I will press for updated dates on these, moving out as I work on getting estimated set dates.</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2730080	83219571	106343	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-07 12:10: RTU delivered to QAE yard on 10/2, working on confirming when we can get this set. Pushing the ROJ out until next week until I can confirm status on curbs and roof to schedule set and when we will pull this RTU from the QAE yard.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-21 14:10: Need confirmation on when we can mobilize crane and curb readiness for BOH RTU. Setting FOH on 10/27, will update once confirmed date for set with MC.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-11-04 15:11: Need to determine when we are setting this, it is sitting in the QAE Yard</P><P>Zack Goertz on 2025-11-11T18:18:19.990Z: This has been postponed via dave. Dave was resequencing the RTU sets so they all get set at once. Curb wrap has been done for about 2 weeks now</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-11 17:11: John owes me 11/11 update</P><P>Zack Goertz on 2025-11-17 13:11: Dave W scope. Resequenced BAM to set all RTU's at once. I had Progressive wrap the RTU curb in the mean time</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-02 11:35: Waiting for TPO Roofs</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-16 15:02: Not available yet</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-12-30T15:15:24.235Z: Actualizing ROJ: RTU delivered to QAE yard on 10/2 - technically have it just not delivered to the site from QAE yard until I can confirm set date</P></BODY></HTML>
