%R	2730091	83222657	106343	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-10-21 12:10: OH Doors are being ordered as one package. Layton is working to breakout the Exterior from the Interior doors but all exterior have not been field verified at this time</P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-11-04 09:11: Final field verification is taking place this week for the exterior OH Doors. All OH doors are being ordered at that point</P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-11-11 08:11: Doors have not been ordered yet as we are looking at options to seperate the interior from the exterior doors for procurement</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-01 14:23: Released vendor.</P></BODY></HTML>
