%R	2730354	83219838	105098	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-08-12 15:08: Pricing is not ready and will be due 8/15. Updated pricing needed by subcontractors. </P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-08-18 11:08: IFC pricing is being updated and resubmitted to QTS due to revisions by the Steel contractor. </P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-08-26 15:08: This change order is in review w/ QTS and Layton to verify and validate the final pricing. </P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-09-17 09:09: PCO is currently in review with QTS </P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-10-07 11:10: This is in review with QTS </P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2730355	83219635	105098	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-08-05 15:08: Olympic West to submit the design to the city on 8/6, City review to 8/7.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-08-12 14:08: Fire Suppression contractor submitted the design to the city for review/approval on 8/8.</P><P>Chris Perales on 2025-09-02 12:09: Delay in getting fire pump approved by the city. City is requesting more documentation from tenant </P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2730356	83219571	105098	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-07 12:10: RTU delivered to QAE yard on 10/2, working on confirming when we can get this set. Pushing the ROJ out until next week until I can confirm status on curbs and roof to schedule set and when we will pull this RTU from the QAE yard.</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2730357	83219562	105098	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-09-02 10:09: Confirmed with QTS that all RTUs (FOH/BOH) as well as all DOAS units will not be available until 9/30. QTS estimated delivery date from the vendor is 9/30.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-09-30 11:09: Pushing until end of next week 10/10 until update is received from QTS/Vendor.<br>NOTE:<br> - Follow-up mail was sent by QTS/Ali Bodur to vendor on 9/25 asking for an update on ETA and estimated delivery date for site. Pending a response as of today 9/30.<br>- J.Capriotti/Layton sent follow-up email today 9/30 to both QTS/vendor to see if we can get a response/update.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-07 12:10: RTUs were delivered to the yard with DOAS units on 10/2/2025, Working on coordinating date to set. Pushing to get these set next week 10/16, so adjusting ROJ.</P></BODY></HTML>
