%R	2731043	83219639	105217	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-08-19 14:08: Confirmed with Olympic West that their order confirmation/procurement date was 7/16/2025 with 10-11 week lead time.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-08-19 14:08: Confirmed with Olympic West that their order confirmation/procurement date was 7/16/2025 with 10-11 week lead time. 11 week lead time puts delivery estimate at 10/1/2025.</P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-10-27 13:10: Half is already onsite. Balance it due on site withing the next 5-10 days</P></BODY></HTML>
