%R	2731047	83219741	105217	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jack Garrett on 2025-09-09 13:09: Terrazzo is scheduled farther out</P><P>Jack Garrett on 2025-09-19 11:09: Terrazzo Flooring Install at Lobby and Stairs begins on 22-December and has 4 week lead time</P><P>Jack Garrett on 2025-09-19 11:09: All Terrazzo Materials have a 4 week lead time</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2731048	83219838	105217	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-08-12 15:08: Pricing is not ready and will be due 8/15. Updated pricing needed by subcontractors. </P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-08-18 11:08: IFC pricing is being updated and resubmitted to QTS due to revisions by the Steel contractor. </P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-08-26 15:08: This change order is in review w/ QTS and Layton to verify and validate the final pricing. </P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-09-17 09:09: PCO is currently in review with QTS </P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-10-07 11:10: This is in review with QTS </P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-10-21 12:10: IFC Package is in review with QTS</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2731049	83219635	105217	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-08-05 15:08: Olympic West to submit the design to the city on 8/6, City review to 8/7.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-08-12 14:08: Fire Suppression contractor submitted the design to the city for review/approval on 8/8.</P><P>Chris Perales on 2025-09-02 12:09: Delay in getting fire pump approved by the city. City is requesting more documentation from tenant </P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-21 14:10: Awaiting response</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-27 16:10: Waiting for feedback from city.</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2731050	83219571	105217	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-07 12:10: RTU delivered to QAE yard on 10/2, working on confirming when we can get this set. Pushing the ROJ out until next week until I can confirm status on curbs and roof to schedule set and when we will pull this RTU from the QAE yard.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-21 14:10: Need confirmation on when we can mobilize crane and curb readiness for BOH RTU. Setting FOH on 10/27, will update once confirmed date for set with MC.</P></BODY></HTML>
