%R	2731097	83221287	105217	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-09-02 10:09: Confirmed with QTS that all RTUs (FOH/BOH) as well as all DOAS units will not be available until 9/30. QTS estimated delivery date from the vendor is 9/30.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-09-30 11:09: Pushing until end of next week 10/10 until update is received from QTS/Vendor.<br>NOTE:<br> - Follow-up mail was sent by QTS/Ali Bodur to vendor on 9/25 asking for an update on ETA and estimated delivery date for site. Pending a response as of today 9/30.<br>- J.Capriotti/Layton sent follow-up email today 9/30 to both QTS/vendor to see if we can get a response/update.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-07 12:10: RTUs were delivered to the yard with DOAS units on 10/2/2025, Working on coordinating date to set. Pushing to get these set next week 10/16, so adjusting ROJ.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-21 13:10: Plan is to set these on 10/27, coordinated and scheduled with QTS QAE Yard and Belaire.</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2731098	83221291	105217	237851	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-09-30 11:09: Pushing ROJ date/date to received for BOH Gen to 10/17, pending status and updates to confirm set dates. Currently BOH Gen pad not set to be complete until roughly 10/15 per latest update from field.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-07 13:10: Editing Note: BOH GEN and XFMR pad to be fully poured and complete 10/15, working on scheduling set, possibly following week. Working on confirming if we will set these ahead of time or set when all zone 3 GENs will be set to avoid remobilizing crane.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-21 13:10: Pending confirmation on pad readiness before setting.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-27 18:10: Currently setting PODS, will follow with gens starting 11/10.</P></BODY></HTML>
